{"run_id": "20260921T140551Z-95bc3f", "case_id": "pipl-008", "category": "terminology", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "个人信息保护法是从哪些角度来界定\"敏感个人信息\"的？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》第二十八条，敏感个人信息是从**两个角度**来界定的：\n\n1. **侵害后果角度**：一旦泄露或者非法使用，容易导致自然人的人格尊严受到侵害，或者人身、财产安全受到危害。\n2. **信息类型角度**：包括生物识别、宗教信仰、特定身份、医疗健康、金融账户、行踪轨迹等信息，以及不满十四周岁未成年人的个人信息。", "latency_ms": 2748, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.5, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 2 位（MRR=0.50）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 3/3"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
