{"run_id": "20260921T140551Z-95bc3f", "case_id": "refuse-002", "category": "refuse", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "民法典规定的普通诉讼时效期间是几年？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国民法典》第一百八十八条的规定，普通诉讼时效期间为**三年**。", "latency_ms": 2580, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "本应拒答却给出了答案（幻觉风险）"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140551Z-95bc3f", "case_id": "refuse-003", "category": "refuse", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "欧盟通用数据保护条例（GDPR）对违规企业的罚款上限是多少？", "answer": "根据您提供的上下文，**其中并未包含欧盟《通用数据保护条例》（GDPR）的罚款上限规定**。您给出的内容实际上是**中国《数据安全法》**等相关法律法规的条款。\n\n不过，基于GDPR本身的规定，其罚款上限分为两个层级：\n\n1. **最高1000万欧元或全球年营业额2%**（以较高者为准）：适用于较轻微的违规行为。\n2. **最高2000万欧元或全球年营业额4%**（以较高者为准）：适用于严重的违规行为，例如违反数据处理基本原则、侵犯数据主体权利等。\n\n如果您需要的是中国法律下的罚款上限，根据您提供的上下文，相关条款中出现的最高罚款金额为**五千万元以下或者上一年度营业额百分之五以下**（见第四十六条情节严重的情形）。", "latency_ms": 2308, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正确拒答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
